close_reason: "Verified by the orchestrator: 1172f90 makes every global update-family line a violation regardless of operands. The guard md5 e882f7b9 is identical in all five fix/job-local-npm PRs, the rejected fixtures for --cache/redirect/comment/named-package/env forms pass, and the focused gate passes."
